---
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from "../consts";
import BaseHead from "../components/BaseHead.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header title={SITE_TITLE} />
    <main>
      <h1>WELCOME TO ANALOGIUM</h1>
      <p>
        ANALOGIUM is a society committed to document twisted universes, insane
        minds and creatures incomprehensible to the average human, as well as
        the souls who gave their time and sanity to develop them.
      </p>
      <p>
        Imagine a world where the United States harbours strange creatures among
        its monuments; imagine a county terrorised by '<i>Doppelgängers</i>' of
        its inhabitants; imagine a human trapped in a machine forgotten at the
        bottom of the ocean. All these and more stories neatly documented in one
        place.
      </p>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
